:3138352,"name":"Joe Lockwood","username":"joeojazz","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/www.chiefdelphi.com/joeojazz/{size}/193359_2.png","created_at":"2023-02-02T16:27:40.810Z","cooked":"\u003caside class=\"quote quote-modified\" data-post=\"7\" data-topic=\"400373\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cimg alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://www.chiefdelphi.com/user_avatar/www.chiefdelphi.com/randomstring/48/170695_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"quote-title__text-content\"\u003e\n      \u003ca href=\"https://www.chiefdelphi.com/t/sysid-gains-on-sds-mk4i-modules/400373/7\"\u003eSysId gains on SDS MK4i Modules\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/technical/programming/30\"\u003e\u003cspan data-category-id=\"30\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #F7941D; --category-badge-text-color: #FFF; --parent-category-badge-color: #3AB54A;\" data-parent-category-id=\"9\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category --style-square --has-parent\" title=\"Discussion of any ideas, algorithms, etc.\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"badge-category__name\"\u003eProgramming\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003cblockquote\u003e\n    Check out this thread about using SysID and SDS modules. \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/bmongar\"\u003e@Bmongar\u003c/a\u003e and I both got similar results tuning MK4s and MK3s respectively. Our team has MK4is for the season, but haven’t characterized it yet. \n\n\nTo lock the modules into place for characterization I used some small cut blocks of wood and used clamps to hold them in place. \n \u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://www.chiefdelphi.com/uploads/default/original/3X/4/8/480da9b8e92fbd0456716689b3c69768f703de7e.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://www.chiefdelphi.com/uploads/default/480da9b8e92fbd0456716689b3c69768f703de7e\" title=\"IMG_2241\"\u003e[IMG_2241]\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://www.chiefdelphi.com/uploads/default/original/3X/8/c/8c94966af3f3d5859f1c3e0d012c4ccff5c43008.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://www.chiefdelphi.com/uploads/default/8c94966af3f3d5859f1c3e0d012c4ccff5c43008\" title=\"IMG_2240\"\u003e[IMG_2240]\u003c/a\u003e\n  \u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n","post_number":8,"post_type":1,"posts_count":14,"updated_at":"2023-02-02T16:27:40.810Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":6,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":4,"reads":171,"readers_count":170,"score":59.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":424060,"topic_slug":"sysid-help","display_username":"Joe Lockwood","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":true,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://www.chiefdelphi.com/t/sysid-gains-on-sds-mk4i-modules/400373/7","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"SysId gains on SDS MK4i Modules","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"","reply_to_user":{"id":55168,"username":"Rzheng1232","name":"Ryan zheng","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/www.chiefdelphi.com/rzheng1232/{size}/182897_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":26945,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"user_custom_fields":{"user_field_4":"5712 Programming Mentor"},"post_url":"/t/sysid-help/424060/8","custom_user_title":"5712 Programming Mentor","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":3138406,"name":"Ryan zheng","username":"Rzheng1232","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/www.ch